  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BUE-MRF-2025-10 Presentacion Libro de buenas practicas de la Defensoria Nacional, premio Tulipan 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We organized a book launch event for Stella Maris Martinez and her  Public Defender&apos;s team. The publication  summarizes their work history and presents their achievements in implementing a gender perspective in public defense work and its impact on the justice system. It also reports on the strategies deployed to overcome difficulties, which will be a relevant input for identifying future challenges. This material will be distributed to all public defender offices at federal and regional levels. It gives us a good networking opportunity among high-ranking legal authorities in the field of human rights. And it fits as a symbolic conclusion to the Tulip 2024 award but also to the career of the Public Defender, who is retiring in February.</narrative>
  </description>
